        "original_id": "b486aadf-16ad-5e2d-920a-28900bbf5f56",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Drank in My Cup, purple drank\n- Concepts: codeine-promethazine cocktail, recreational drug use, chopped and screwed music\n- Places: H-Town\n\nFacts:\n- In the song \"Drank in My Cup,\" the repeated use of the word \"drank\" clearly refers to purple drank.\n- Purple drank is a codeine-promethazine cocktail served in Sprite.\n- Purple drank is symbolic of the H-Town hip-hop scene and is classically associated with chopped and screwed music.\n- Purple drank is a slang term for a concoction containing prescription-strength cough syrup used in a manner inconsistent with its labeling.\n- Purple drank is therefore considered a recreational drug.",
